      <h3 id="admission-plugin-default-behavior_ephemeral-storage-csi-inline" class="group scroll-mt-20">Default behavior for the CSI Volume Admission plugin<a href="#admission-plugin-default-behavior_ephemeral-storage-csi-inline" class="ml-2 text-muted-foreground opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 no-underline" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1">&para;</a></h3>
